# dr admission id (kit-only, 32-reg-dr.sh:52-68; not in the repo). PROPOSAL: 2026-10-27a instead of the draft's 2026-10-25a.
# Both are unspent: no hit in `git log --all -S<id>`, none in the tree at dbc5858, none in F13/F13-prep/F13-RESULT or any
# text file under F:/TBoundAssets except the F14-prep drafts; F13 used g1/rp 2026-10-24a and dr 2026-10-23c.
# Why 27a: the ids carry the date of the id commit (F13: 10-24a on the 10-24 commit) and that commit is made on or after
# 2026-10-27; the kit only checks inequality (32-reg-dr.sh:56-63). The g1/rp 27a ids are committed (ade72cc).
# It must differ from PREV_DR_ADMISSION_ID, every id in DR_ADMISSION_REFUSE and the g1/rp ids of F13 and F14.
